---
import LegalPage from '../../components/pages/LegalPage.astro';
import { site } from '../../config';
---
<LegalPage lang="en" title="Privacy" description="What data this site processes and why." alternate="/privacidad/">
  <p class="todo">Template: review with a privacy-policy generator or adviser before publishing.</p>
  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>{site.owner}, {site.city}, Germany. Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
  <h2>No cookies, no analytics</h2>
  <p>This site sets no cookies and uses no analytics. Fonts are served from this domain; there is no connection to Google Fonts.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted by Netlify (Netlify, Inc., USA). The server logs technical data (IP address, date, page) to keep it secure. Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR.</p>
  <h2>Contact and bookings</h2>
  <p>If you email me or book a call, I use your name, email and what you tell me only to reply and prepare the call. Bookings are handled by Calendly (Calendly LLC, USA) under its own privacy policy. Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR.</p>
  <h2>Free guide</h2>
  <p>If you request the guide, I use your email only to send it. Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR. You can ask me to delete it at any time.</p>
  <h2>Links to projects</h2>
  <p>Portfolio links open sites hosted by third parties (Lovable, Netlify, Google Cloud and others) under their own policies.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can request access, correction, deletion, restriction, portability or object to processing by emailing {site.email}, and you may complain to the competent data-protection authority.</p>
</LegalPage>
